WEBVTT

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:31.333
To get halfway to zero by 2030,

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:33.870
we're going to have to reduce
annual emissions

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.940
by about 10 percent a year.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:39.110
And we've never reduced
annual emissions in any year

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:40.667
in the history of the planet.

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.150
So let's break this down.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:44.113
Seventy-five percent of the emissions

00:00:44.113 --> 00:00:47.270
come from the 20 largest
emitting countries.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.557
And from four sectors of their economy.

00:00:50.557 --> 00:00:51.830
The first is grid.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.550
Second, transportation.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:55.077
The third from the buildings.

00:00:55.077 --> 00:00:57.477
And the fourth from industrial activities.

00:00:57.477 --> 00:01:01.623
We've got to fix all those,
at speed and at scale.